# TASK R13 (D67): the tree had no ignore file, so every build and rig run left
# untracked noise that had to be filtered by eye. Everything below is a build
# product or rig scratch and can be regenerated from src/ + tests/.
#
# NOTE: the shipped binaries under bin/ ARE tracked and are pinned in
# MANIFEST-md5; they are deliberately NOT ignored.

# build products
x64/
dist/
*.o

# rig scratch (dot-files the stability targets create and delete themselves)
tests/.*
tests/*.log
tests/*.pid

# a default run's log, written next to the config it served
multics.log
